  "doc": "Your picture (image, video or camera) cut into scanlines and stood up in 3D: rows of glowing ridgelines, each one a line of the picture raised by its brightness over a dark curtain that shows the picture dimly. Every phrase the camera takes another path (a low crane, a flyover, an orbit, straight down, an arc) and the rows can turn into a pin-screen, a point cloud or a cube field; kicks push the peaks up, a glow runs back through the rows on the beat, and the palette turns from ink to dusk to sea.",
